{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：14:35 2026-07-03 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今（3日）中午1時11分，有途人報案指一名年約70歲男子，由青衣路1號一條天橋躍下，倒臥青衣污水處理廠內地面，救護員接報到場，將已陷昏迷的男事主送往仁濟醫院搶救。警方正調查事主身份及其墮橋原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"救護車到場。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3298342cdfc6f780fd82f675950a6c32/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-03_at_14_23_57.jpeg\" title=\"救護車到場。梁國峰攝\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3dfcb420ef37a624ba113afcc28db626/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-03_at_14_23_56.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"事主昏迷送仁濟醫院搶救。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/249dec2f30f57692caf664265c20cc86/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-03_at_14_22_04.jpeg\" title=\"事主昏迷送仁濟醫院搶救。梁國峰攝\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3daf429034f596dea9ee216b74b7e106/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-03_at_14_22_03.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-03T06:59:16.422444+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}